{"title":"White Horse","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 10 Wildlife that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(539.2px,-4810.9px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-3/18.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-768px;top:4608px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-3/19.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-768px;top:4864px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-2/18.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:4608px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-2/19.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:4864px\"><i style=\"left:-539.2px;top:4810.9px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 1651, 1847 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Havenheim\">Havenheim</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"horse-white\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/horse\"><img src=\"data/img/a40d3033779e14c5e652.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Horse</b><span>Lv 10</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Wildlife: <a href=\"#/monster/seagull\">Seagull</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rabbit\">Rabbit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/chicken\">Chicken</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/frog\">Frog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/crab\">Crab</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/deer\">Deer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sheep\">Sheep</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/horse-black\">Black Horse</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/horse-brown\">Brown Horse</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/cdeafab5bfa5728813e0.webp\" alt=\"White Horse\"></div><h3>White Horse</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>10 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 0–10)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Wildlife</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>31</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>2 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}